        "Content": "McDonald Property, Lucan's longest-established Auctioneers, Valuers and Estate Agents, are delighted to present 8 Tullyhall Park to the market.\r\n\r\nThis attractive four-bedroom semi-detached home comes to the market in excellent condition, ready for immediate occupation and with the added benefit of no onward chain.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 117 sq. m., the well-proportioned accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and offers excellent living space throughout. On entering, the welcoming hallway features a generous guest WC and leads to two interconnected reception rooms, creating a seamless and versatile living environment. A newly fitted kitchen is complemented by a separate utility room.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from a modern en-suite. A contemporary family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a poured concrete driveway to the front, accompanied by a lawned area. To the rear is a private, mature garden with a desirable south-facing aspect, providing an excellent outdoor space that enjoys plenty of natural sunlight. The garden is predominantly laid in lawn and features a mature tree.\r\n\r\nA particularly notable feature of the property is the substantial side passageway, which offers excellent potential for future extension, subject to the necessary Planning Permission.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking an amenity green, 8 Tullyhall Park is situated within a highly regarded, family-friendly neighbourhood. The property enjoys an excellent location close to a wide range of local amenities, including schools, shops and sporting facilities. Residents also benefit from convenient access to Aura Leisure Centre, with its swimming pool and gym facilities, as well as the popular Griffeen Valley Park and Playground.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by public transport, while the property also offers superb connectivity to the N4, N7 and M50 road networks. Lucan Village is within easy reach, and Kishoge Railway Station provides an additional transport option for commuters.\r\n\r\nWith its spacious accommodation, excellent condition, south-facing rear garden and significant potential to extend, 8 Tullyhall Park represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located family home in a popular and convenient residential setting.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 3.97m x 2.45m with laminate wood floor, coved ceiling and alarm panel.\r\n\r\nGuest WC: 1.92m x 0.99m with tiled floor, WC, WHB, tiled splash back and window.\r\n\r\nReception Room 1: with laminate wood floor, coved ceiling, feature timber fireplace and French double doors to second reception room.\r\n\r\nReception Room 2: with laminate wood floor, coved ceiling and sliding patio door to rear.\r\n\r\nKitchen: with laminate wood floor, newly fitted kitchen cabinets, work top and splash back.\r\n\r\nUtility Room: 1.74m x 1.37m with laminate wood floor, counter top, Ideal gas boiler and window.\r\n\r\nUpstairs:\r\n\r\nLanding and stairs with new freshly laid carpet.\r\n\r\nLanding: with Hotpress cupboard and attic access.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: with laminate wood floor and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 2.47m x 1.08m with tiled floor, partially tiled walls, WC, WHB and shower enclosure.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with laminate wood floor and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: with laminate wood floor and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: with laminate wood floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.09m x 1.70m with tiled floor, partially tiled walls, WC, WHB, bath tub, glass shower screen and Triton T90sr.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nSouth facing rear garden.\r\nCul-de-sac location adjacent amenity green.\r\nLarge side entrance with potential to extend subject to PP\r\nNewly fitted kitchen\r\nNo onward chain\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nExternal tap\r\nRed brick fascade with granite cillls\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMeasurements provided are approximate and intended for guidance. Descriptions, photographs and floor plans are provided for illustrative and guidance purposes. Errors, omissions, inaccuracies, or mis-descriptions in these materials do not entitle any party to claims, actions, or compensation against McDonald Property or the vendor. Prospective buyers or interested parties are responsible for conducting their own due diligence, inspections, or other inquiries to verify the accuracy of the information provided. McDonald Property have not tested any appliances, apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Prospective buyers or interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items."
